OL,3,GNEWSAFormer J&J site cleared for #31m
OL,4,Aredevelopment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #31m scheme to transform a former
OL,7,Foffice site of the US pharmaceutical
OL,8,Fgiant Johnson & Johnson (J&J) beside
OL,9,Fthe M40 has been approved.
OL,11,FThe existing building on Holmers Farm
OL,12,FWay in High Wycombe will be demolished
OL,13,Fto make way for an industrial and
OL,14,Fdistribution centre, after the company
OL,15,Fdecided to relocate staff to a new
OL,16,Fheadquarters in Maidenhead, Berkshire.
OL,18,FConcerns raised before the application
OL,19,Fwas approved by Buckinghamshire Council
OL,20,Fon Wednesday included noise, lorry
OL,21,Fmovements, overnight parking and
OL,22,Foperating hours.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
